WEBVTT

00:03:29.829 --> 00:03:32.038
and you're burning
the candle at both ends,

00:03:32.038 --> 00:03:35.913
know that it's OK to invest in something
that will free up your time.

00:03:35.913 --> 00:03:38.538
Hire a local high schooler
to mow your lawn

00:03:38.579 --> 00:03:40.829
or get someone to clean your house.

00:03:40.871 --> 00:03:42.329
These may be a little pricey,

00:03:42.371 --> 00:03:45.538
but the time you save
will be worth every penny.

00:03:45.579 --> 00:03:48.579
By making these small changes
to your discretionary spending,

00:03:48.621 --> 00:03:51.079
you can not only spend less

00:03:51.079 --> 00:03:54.204
but actually get more
happiness and satisfaction

00:03:54.204 --> 00:03:55.413
from your spending.

00:03:55.413 --> 00:03:58.538
It can mean a life with
fewer guilty pleasures

00:03:58.538 --> 00:03:59.704
and less regret.

00:03:59.704 --> 00:04:01.079
Now who wouldn't want that?